          %h2#tarskivaught_test Tarski-Vaught test
          %p
            A simple criterion for when one structure is an elementary substructure of another is given by the Tarski-Vaught test. Let
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi L
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} L
            be the language (the set of first-order formulas) over some given signature.
          #Tarski-Vaught.num_prop
            %h6#proposition Proposition
            %p
              A substructure
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
